# The Prismworks stair. Shared ground: no chapter owns this file, so nothing
# here may grant a clue. It teaches the boards and it keeps Wick company.

@node tower_first
  Inside, the Prismworks smells of cold stone and lamp oil and, faintly, of
  turpentine.
  The stair goes up in a slow spiral and stops three floors short of the top,
  at a landing of raw planks somebody has roped off with a bootlace.
  Every landing has a wide flat table, scarred with forty years of chalk.
  Whatever the Tinters used these tables for, they used them for thinking.
  Your journal has margins. The tables have room. You could lay out what you
  know here and look at all of it at once, which is the only trick this job
  has ever had.

@node tower_wick
  [if flag tw.first == 0]
  set tw.first = 1
  WICK: Mm. You found the tables.
  WICK: Tinters did their arguing on those. With themselves, mostly.
  YOU:
    * (curious) How do they work?  -> tower_how
    * (kind) Do you want to come up and sit with me while I think?  -> tower_sit
    * (dry) I do my arguing standing up.  -> tower_how
  [else]
  [if flag board.ch5_where == 1]
  WICK(moved): Up you go, then. Mind the third plank. Mind it kindly.
  [else]
  WICK: Take your time. She has waited longer than this for company.
  [end]
  [end]

@node tower_how
  WICK: You write the sentence with the holes in it. Then you put your bits
  of the world in the holes until the sentence stops lying.
  WICK: When you have filled every hole, you say Deduce, and it tells you how
  many of them hold. Not which. How many.
  YOU:
    * (dry) That is a miserly sort of help.  -> tower_miser
    * (curious) And if I am wrong?  -> tower_wrong
    * (kind) That sounds like enough.  -> tower_wrong

@node tower_miser
  WICK(laughing): It is. It is also the only kind that leaves you the
  satisfaction.
  goto tower_wrong

@node tower_wrong
  WICK: Then you are wrong, and you move a word, and you say it again. Nobody
  is counting and nothing is taken off you.
  WICK: Iris used to be up there for hours. Wrong for hours. Happy as anything.

@node tower_sit
  WICK(moved): ...Aye. All right. I will sit on the bottom step.
  trust wick 1
  WICK: I will not be any help. I will just be here.
